WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.509
Welcome to Orbit. Hello, world. Our focus is am / is / are.

2
00:00:07.509 --> 00:00:13.543
Use am with I, is with he, she and it, and are with you, we and they.

3
00:00:13.543 --> 00:00:15.727
Are you our new teacher?

4
00:00:15.727 --> 00:00:18.201
He is not at school today.

5
00:00:18.201 --> 00:00:20.280
I am a new student.

6
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:29.678
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
